      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "VladimirSanguinePool",
        "name": "Sanguine Pool",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Vladimir sinks into a pool of blood, becoming untargetable for 2 seconds. Additionally, enemies on the pool are slowed and Vladimir siphons life from them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Vladimir sinks into a pool of blood for 2 seconds, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">37.5% decaying Move Speed</span> for 1 second and becoming <span>Untargetable</span> and <span>Ghosted</span> while <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies in the pool by 40%.<br /><br />Vladimir deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/135/190/245/300 + ([[si:scalehealth]]15% bonus Health)) magic damage</span> and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(24/40.5/57/73.5/90 + (4.5% bonus Health)) Health</span> per enemy over the duration.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability can be used while charging <span>Tides of Blood</span>.<br />Vladimir can't Attack or use other Abilities while inside the pool.<br /><span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">Healing</span> is 60% effective against minions.<br />Untargetable units won't be affected by enemy Attacks or Abilities unless they've already been hit by them.<br />Ghosted units can pass through other units.</span>",
