        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Vladimir infects an area with a virulent plague. Affected enemies take increased damage for the duration. After a few seconds, Hemoplague deals magic damage to infected enemies and heals Vladimir for each enemy Champion hit.",
        "bodyHtml": "Vladimir creates a virulent plague, causing its victims to take 10% increased damage from all sources for 4 seconds. After it expires, Vladimir deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scaleap]]70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to all infected targets. Vladimir restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scaleap]]70% Ability Power)) Health</span> if he hits a champion, and restores an additional <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(60/100/140 + (28% Ability Power)) Health</span> for each champion beyond the first.",
